WEBVTT

00:05:29.827 --> 00:05:32.265
chunki Xitoy imperatorlari o'zining
siyosiy

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:34.636
dushmanlarini surgun qilib aynan tog'ga
yuborgan.

00:05:34.636 --> 00:05:39.647
Hozirgi paytda "surgun"ning ma'nosi
"ketish"ga aylangan.

00:05:39.647 --> 00:05:42.218
Sizga qayerga chiqishni ko'rsatayotgan
og'iz,

00:05:42.218 --> 00:05:44.146
"chiqish" degani.

00:05:44.146 --> 00:05:47.787
Bu slayd menga ushbu chiqishimni
yakunlashimni va

00:05:47.787 --> 00:05:49.670
sahnadan ketishimni eslatmoqda. Rahmat.

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:53.639
(Qarsaklar)